---

<Layout
  title="錦乃｜WORKS｜作品紹介"
  description="錦乃の作品一覧。江戸城や熊本城などの城郭、和風建築、和風の町並み、神社・庭園から洋風ファンタジー建築、キャラクター作品まで、幅広い制作作品を城郭を中心に、町並みや神社、武家屋敷、創作作品、図面・建築考証など錦乃の制作作品を紹介しています。"
>

<section class="bg-[#faf8f3] min-h-screen">

   <!-- Hero Image -->
<section class="relative h-[820px] overflow-hidden">

  <img
    src="/images/works-bg.jpg"
    alt="作品紹介"
    class="works-bg absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover select-none pointer-events-none"
    draggable="false"
  />

  </section>

<section class="relative overflow-hidden">

  <img
    src="/images/washi-bg1.png"
    alt=""
    class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover pointer-events-none select-none"
    draggable="false"
  />

  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-white/25"></div>

  <!-- Introduction -->

<section class="relative overflow-hidden py-20">

  <div
    class="mx-auto max-w-6xl rounded-3xl
           border border-white/40
           bg-white/10
           backdrop-blur-xl
           shadow-2xl
           px-12 py-16"
  >

    <p
      class="tracking-[0.45em] text-sm text-white"
      style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
    >
      WORKS
    </p>

    <h1
      class="mt-5 text-5xl md:text-7xl text-white"
      style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
    >
      作品紹介
    </h1>

    <p
      class="mt-10 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-10 text-white"
      style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
    >
      日本の城郭や和風建築、
      和風の町並み、神社、庭園など実在する建物や歴史考証から再現・復元した景観、
      乗り物、ファンタジー、キャラクター造形に至るまでたくさん掲載しています。
      <br />
      ぜひ、お気に入りの作品を見つけてみてください。
    </p>

  </div>

</section>

  <!-- Works List -->

  <section
    class="relative min-h-screen overflow-hidden py-32"
  >

    <div
      class="relative mx-auto max-w-[1800px] px-8"
    >


      <div class="works-grid">


        {
          works.map((work,index)=>(

            <a
              href={work.link}
              class="works-card"
              
            >


              <div class="works-image-wrap">

                <img
                  src={work.image}
                  alt={work.title}
                  loading="lazy"
                  class="works-image"
                />

              </div>


              <div class="works-body">

                <p class="works-category">
                  {work.category}
                </p>


                <h2
                  class="works-title"
                  style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
                >
                  {work.title}
                </h2>

              </div>


            </a>

          ))
        }


      </div>


    </div>


  </section>

</section>

</section>


<style>

/* =========================================
   Works Grid
========================================= */

.works-grid {
  display: grid !important;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr) !important;
  gap: 20px !important;
  align-items: start;
}


/* =========================================
   Card
========================================= */

.works-card {
  position: relative;
  display: block;

  aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;

  overflow: hidden;

  border-radius: 1.35rem;

  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);

  background: rgba(100, 180, 220, 0.18);

  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);

  box-shadow:
    0 10px 30px rgba(40, 100, 130, 0.12);

  transform-style: preserve-3d;

  transition:
    transform 0.45s cubic-bezier(.22, 1, .36, 1),
    box-shadow 0.45s ease;
}




/* =========================================
   Hover
========================================= */

.works-card:hover {
  transform:
    translateY(-8px)
    rotateX(2deg)
    rotateY(-2deg);

  box-shadow:
    0 22px 45px rgba(30, 100, 140, 0.22);
}


/* =========================================
   Image
========================================= */

.works-image-wrap {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;

  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;

  overflow: hidden;
}


.works-image {
  display: block;

  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;

  aspect-ratio: auto;

  object-fit: cover;

  border-radius: 0;

  transition:
    transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(.22, 1, .36, 1),
    filter 0.5s ease;
}


/* Hover時に少しズーム */

.works-card:hover .works-image {
  transform: scale(1.045);
}


/* =========================================
   Text Area
========================================= */

.works-body {
  position: absolute;

  inset: 0;

  z-index: 2;

  display: block;

  padding: 1.2rem;

  pointer-events: none;
}


/* =========================================
   Category
   → 左下
========================================= */

.works-category {
  position: absolute;

  left: 1.2rem;
  bottom: 1.05rem;

  margin: 0;

  font-family:
    "Noto Sans JP",
    "Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN",
    "Yu Gothic",
    sans-serif;

  font-size: clamp(0.7rem, 0.9vw, 1rem);

  font-weight: 600;

  letter-spacing: 0.08em;

  line-height: 1.3;

  color: #ffffff;

  text-shadow:
    0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
}


/* =========================================
   Title
   → 左上
========================================= */

.works-title {
  position: absolute;

  top: 1.1rem;
  left: 1.1rem;

  margin: 0;

  display: inline-block;

  max-width: calc(100% - 2.2rem);

  padding:
    0.45rem
    0.7rem;

  border-radius: 0.65rem;

  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);

  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);

  backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);

  font-family:
    "Noto Sans JP",
    "Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN",
    "Yu Gothic",
    sans-serif !important;

  font-size: clamp(0.8rem, 1vw, 1.1rem);

  font-weight: 700;

  line-height: 1.25;

  letter-spacing: 0.03em;

  color: #ffffff;

  text-shadow:
    0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22);

  box-sizing: border-box;
}


/* =========================================
   Mobile
========================================= */

@media (max-width: 1100px) {

  .works-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr) !important;
  }

}


@media (max-width: 760px) {

  .works-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr) !important;
    gap: 14px !important;
  }

  .works-card {
    border-radius: 1.1rem;
  }

  .works-body {
    padding: 0.8rem;
  }

  .works-title {
    top: 0.75rem;
    left: 0.75rem;

    max-width: calc(100% - 1.5rem);

    padding:
      0.45rem
      0.65rem;

    border-radius: 0.5rem;

    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .works-category {
    left: 0.75rem;
    bottom: 0.7rem;

    font-size: 0.65rem;
  }

}


@media (max-width: 480px) {

  .works-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;
  }

  .works-card {
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
  }

}


/* =========================================
   Introduction / Container
   ※既存のレイアウト用
========================================= */

@media (max-width: 640px) {

  .works-container {
    padding-left: 0.8rem;
    padding-right: 0.8rem;
  }

}

</style>


</Layout>